ng a notepad! It's right here! I drew a picture of you riding a tank on it!", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "Focus, Major. This is a major naval center for the Federation. We must annihilate all Federation presence here. They cannot be allowed to continue bringing Dragoon forces onto the mainland. Strike fast! No prisoners!", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}, {"conditions": [{"type": "endGame", "player": 1, "victory": true}], "responses": [{"type": "disableControllers", "disable": true}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "Victory! With this naval center demolished, the Federation's ability to bring in further Dragoon support is crippled. It should be a simple matter for the vast Akadian army to clean up the remnants. I must contact the General to report our success.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL DURAND", "message": "Yes, Lieutenant?", "avatar": "evil_durand", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "The Federation shipyards are no more, sir. The flow of Dragoons should now be a trickle. The crisis is averted once again by my magnificence.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL DURAND", "message": "Return to rejoin the main force. Then we will sweep across the land and purge our enemies from it.", "avatar": "evil_durand", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "Yes, sir. We'll return right away.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN ARGENT", "message": "Buck, buck, buck, bakaw!", "avatar": "argent", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "What are you doing Argent?", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN ARGENT", "message": "That's my chicken sound. No good?", "avatar": "argent", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "Leaving so soon, Hayne? Probably for the best. I'll be sort of a legend in the Federation for constantly outwitting and escaping from the Akadian Bumbler, Lieutenant Hayne.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "Ridiculous! I am the finest military mind of this generation! I have beaten your forces again and again. You are no match for me.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "And here you are, returning home like a good little boy, tail between your legs.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "I have my orders!", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "Exactly. Durand knows that you can't hack it out here anymore. He knows I've been saving my best forces and he knows that you can't measure up.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "Mayjor, gather the troops. We advance on the position of Captain Tucker's radio broadcast.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "But it's an island fortress! And it's a trap. He wants you to disobey orders. Even I know that, and I'm an idiot!", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "I don't care. The world will know that no one can defeat me.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}, {"conditions": [{"type": "startGame"}], "responses": [{"type": "disableAllUnits", "disable": true, "player": 1}, {"type": "enableUnit", "enable": true, "player": 1, "unit": "Strike Commando"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "enable": true, "player": 1, "unit": "H